{"duration_api_ms":122813,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9a106171-c1fd-4127-9423-8a58909d93e2","total_cost_usd":0.2791172,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23025,"cache_read_input_tokens":94383,"output_tokens":17735,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8312},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":23025,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":481,"cache_read_input_tokens":23014,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10199,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10199},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1219,"outputTokens":174,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0002089,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":153,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":17735,"cacheReadInputTokens":94383,"cacheCreationInputTokens":23025,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.27890830000000005,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":8312,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01PcP7Ge4K8RCQQQrYV4Js4Y","tool_input":{"command":"mkdir -p $TMPDIR/gen && cat > $TMPDIR/gen/gen.py <<'EOF'\nimport math\nT = 1.2          # seconds per crank / wheel revolution\nN = 36           # keyframes per revolution\nBB = (380, 390); CR = 40\nHIP = (340, 252); L1, L2 = 90, 100\n\ndef knee(foot):\n    dx, dy = foot[0]-HIP[0], foot[1]-HIP[1]\n    d = math.hypot(dx, dy)\n    d = min(d, L1+L2-0.01)\n    a = (L1*L1 - L2*L2 + d*d) / (2*d)\n    h = math.sqrt(max(L1*L1 - a*a, 0))\n    mx, my = HIP[0]+a*dx/d, HIP[1]+a*dy/d\n    return (mx + h*dy/d, my - h*dx/d)   # bend forward (toward +x)\n\ndef pedal(a): return (BB[0]+CR*math.cos(a), BB[1]+CR*math.sin(a))\ndef seq(f, phase):\n    return [f(2*math.pi*k/N + phase) for k in range(N+1)]\ndef vals(items): return \";\".join(items)\ndef anim(attr, values):\n    return f'<animate attributeName=\"{attr}\" dur=\"{T}s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"{vals(values)}\"/>'\n\ndef leg(phase, col, w):\n    ds=[]; fs=[]\n    for a in [2*math.pi*k/N+phase for k in range(N+1)]:\n        p = pedal(a); k = knee(p)\n        ds.append(f\"M{HIP[0]},{HIP[1]} L{k[0]:.1f},{k[1]:.1f} L{p[0]:.1f},{p[1]:.1f} l16,-2\")\n    return f'<path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"{col}\" stroke-width=\"{w}\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"{ds[0]}\">{anim(\"d\", ds)}</path>'\n\ndef crank_pedal(phase, col):\n    x2=[f\"{pedal(2*math.pi*k/N+phase)[0]:.1f}\" for k in range(N+1)]\n    y2=[f\"{pedal(2*math.pi*k/N+phase)[1]:.1f}\" for k in range(N+1)]\n    px=[f\"{float(v)-11:.1f}\" for v in x2]\n    py=[f\"{float(v)+2:.1f}\" for v in y2]\n    return (f'<line x1=\"{BB[0]}\" y1=\"{BB[1]}\" x2=\"{x2[0]}\" y2=\"{y2[0]}\" stroke=\"{col}\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">{anim(\"x2\",x2)}{anim(\"y2\",y2)}</line>'\n            f'<rect x=\"{px[0]}\" y=\"{py[0]}\" width=\"26\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#222\">{anim(\"x\",px)}{anim(\"y\",py)}</rect>')\n\ndef wheel(cx, cy):\n    spokes = \"\".join(f'<line x1=\"{cx}\" y1=\"{cy}\" x2=\"{cx+62*math.cos(i*math.pi/8):.1f}\" y2=\"{cy+62*math.sin(i*math.pi/8):.1f}\"/>' for i in range(16))\n    return f'''<g>\n  <circle cx=\"{cx}\" cy=\"{cy}\" r=\"68\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b33\" stroke-width=\"7\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"{cx}\" cy=\"{cy}\" r=\"62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9aa3ad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#9aa3ad\" stroke-width=\"1.3\">{spokes}\n    <rect x=\"{cx+40}\" y=\"{cy-4}\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#e8553d\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"0 {cx} {cy}\" to=\"360 {cx} {cy}\" dur=\"{T}s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n  </g>\n  <circle cx=\"{cx}\" cy=\"{cy}\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#444\"/></g>'''\n\nsvg = f'''<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\">\n<title>Pelican riding a bicycle</title>\n<defs>\n  <linearGradient id=\"sky\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#6ec3f2\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#d9f1fb\"/></linearGradient>\n  <g id=\"cloud\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\".9\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"42\" ry=\"14\"/><ellipse cx=\"-18\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"14\"/><ellipse cx=\"14\" cy=\"-16\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"16\"/></g>\n</defs>\n<rect width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"url(#sky)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"75\" r=\"36\" fill=\"#ffe27a\"/>\n<circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"75\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#ffe27a\" opacity=\".3\"/>\n<g>\n  <use href=\"#cloud\" x=\"0\" y=\"80\"/>\n  <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" from=\"900 0\" to=\"-100 0\" dur=\"30s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n</g>\n<g>\n  <use href=\"#cloud\" x=\"0\" y=\"150\"/>\n  <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" from=\"500 0\" to=\"-500 0\" dur=\"40s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n</g>\n<g>\n  <use href=\"#cloud\" x=\"0\" y=\"45\"/>\n  <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" from=\"200 0\" to=\"-800 0\" dur=\"50s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n</g>\n<!-- hills -->\n<path d=\"M0 400 Q120 320 260 390 T520 380 T800 370 V460 H0Z\" fill=\"#9fd18b\"/>\n<path d=\"M0 430 Q200 380 400 425 T800 410 V470 H0Z\" fill=\"#7fbf6a\"/>\n<!-- road -->\n<rect y=\"446\" width=\"800\" height=\"54\" fill=\"#5b5f68\"/>\n<rect y=\"446\" width=\"800\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#44474e\"/>\n<g fill=\"#f4f1e4\">\n  {\"\".join(f'<rect x=\"{x}\" y=\"478\" width=\"60\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\"/>' for x in range(-440, 900, 220))}\n  <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" from=\"0 0\" to=\"-440 0\" dur=\"{T}s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n</g>\n<ellipse cx=\"400\" cy=\"452\" rx=\"230\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#000\" opacity=\".2\"/>\n\n<!-- far leg + far crank -->\n{leg(math.pi, \"#d98a1c\", 10)}\n{crank_pedal(math.pi, \"#555\")}\n\n<!-- bicycle -->\n{wheel(250, 380)}\n{wheel(550, 380)}\n<g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8553d\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n  <path d=\"M250 380 L380 390 L345 268 Z\"/>\n  <path d=\"M345 268 L511 263 L522 300 L380 390\"/>\n  <path d=\"M511 263 L522 300\"/>\n  <path d=\"M522 300 L550 380\" stroke=\"#444\"/>\n  <path d=\"M511 263 L506 246 M498 246 L524 246\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n  <path d=\"M345 268 L343 252\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n</g>\n<path d=\"M318 252 Q345 244 372 254 Q362 266 345 266 Q328 266 318 252Z\" fill=\"#222\"/>\n<circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"390\" r=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\">\n  <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"0 380 390\" to=\"360 380 390\" dur=\"{T}s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n</circle>\n<circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"390\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n\n<!-- pelican -->\n<g id=\"pelican\">\n  <!-- tail -->\n  <path d=\"M300 222 L262 236 L270 218 L260 210 L305 205Z\" fill=\"#e9eef2\" stroke=\"#aab6c0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n  <!-- body -->\n  <ellipse cx=\"345\" cy=\"210\" rx=\"58\" ry=\"40\" transform=\"rotate(-18 345 210)\" fill=\"#f7f9fb\" stroke=\"#aab6c0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- neck -->\n  <path d=\"M385 195 C430 190 385 145 425 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#aab6c0\" stroke-width=\"28\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <path d=\"M385 195 C430 190 385 145 425 120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f7f9fb\" stroke-width=\"24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <!-- head, beak (bobbing) -->\n  <g>\n    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;0 -3;0 0;0 -3;0 0\" dur=\"{T}s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"112\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#f7f9fb\" stroke=\"#aab6c0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <path d=\"M438 120 Q495 175 565 128 L440 126Z\" fill=\"#f0a93a\" stroke=\"#c9801a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <path d=\"M440 102 L568 124 Q572 128 566 130 L442 124Z\" fill=\"#ffc94f\" stroke=\"#c9801a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <path d=\"M563 123 q8 1 8 6 q-2 3 -6 2\" fill=\"#e08a1d\" stroke=\"#c9801a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"437\" cy=\"105\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"438.5\" cy=\"105\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n    <path d=\"M410 98 Q420 88 432 92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5eaee\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  </g>\n  <!-- wing reaching handlebar -->\n  <path d=\"M352 188 Q440 225 522 248 Q526 255 518 255 Q440 255 345 228Z\" fill=\"#dfe6ec\" stroke=\"#aab6c0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n  <path d=\"M470 244 Q500 250 522 248 Q526 255 518 255 Q495 256 468 250Z\" fill=\"#555c66\"/>\n</g>\n\n<!-- near leg + near crank -->\n{crank_pedal(0, \"#333\")}\n{leg(0, \"#f0a93a\", 10)}\n</svg>'''\nopen(\"pelican.svg\",\"w\").write(svg)\nprint(len(svg))\nEOF\npython3 $TMPDIR/gen/gen.py && (which rsvg-convert convert inkscape chromium 2>/dev/null)"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":5,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I wrote `pelican.svg` in the working directory, but I haven't rendered or opened it. Every Bash call failed with a sandbox error (`apply-seccomp … Permission denied`). That means I couldn't render it to check how it looks, and I couldn't run a script to generate the animation. I worked out the leg keyframes by hand and wrote the file directly instead. Please open it in a browser and check it.\n\n**The scene** (800×500, pure SVG with SMIL animation, no scripts):\n- **Pelican:** It sits on the saddle with a white body, an S-curved neck, and a big orange bill with a pouch. One wing grips the handlebar, and the head bobs twice per pedal revolution.\n- **Legs:** Each leg has a hip, a knee and a foot, and the foot follows the pedal around the crank circle. I worked out 12 knee positions per revolution so the knees bend plausibly. The far leg runs half a turn out of phase and is drawn behind the frame.\n- **Bicycle:** The frame is red. The wheel spokes spin, the cranks and pedals turn, and the chainring turns too.\n- **Background:** The road dashes scroll left at the same speed the wheels turn, so the bike appears to roll forward. Clouds drift across the sky.\n\nEverything loops every 1.2 seconds. The 12-frame legs are slightly angular where the keyframes are interpolated, which I'd expect to be barely visible at this size.","ttft_ms":28910,"type":"result","duration_ms":121122,"uuid":"913fe8da-4067-4db0-8eae-e28499802ec0","ttft_stream_ms":2293,"time_to_request_ms":143,"first_content_frame_ms":2294,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
